From: t5dr <t5dr@local>
Subject: [PATCH] 96 Buffered frame trace, presentation-stage timing and truthful shared-image counters

Opt-in host diagnostics only. No guest scheduling or simulation changes.

diff --git a/ps2xRuntime/include/runtime/ps2_perf_stats.h b/ps2xRuntime/include/runtime/ps2_perf_stats.h
--- a/ps2xRuntime/include/runtime/ps2_perf_stats.h
+++ b/ps2xRuntime/include/runtime/ps2_perf_stats.h
@@ -31,6 +31,9 @@
